# Purpose

This document defines every major user journey within Aura.

A User Flow describes:

• User Goal
• Starting Point
• User Actions
• System Response
• Success Criteria
• Error Recovery

Every flow should feel effortless.

The ideal experience is one where the user never wonders what to do next.

---

# User Journey Philosophy

Aura is designed around intentions, not devices.

Traditional Smart Home

