# Flow 01 — First Launch

Goal

Help the user understand Aura within 60 seconds.

Steps

Launch Aura

↓

Welcome Screen

↓

Privacy Overview

↓

Choose Home

↓

Discover Devices

↓

Setup Complete

↓

Home Dashboard

Requirements

• No account required
• Skip available at every step
• Maximum setup time: 2 minutes

Success

The user reaches the Home screen with at least one connected device.

